Good morning,

Can I ask that a new release of alsa-plugins is rolled, incorporating
the PulseAudio stability fixes since 1.0.24? Gentoo has now stabilised
a newer version of PulseAudio, and I would have to start rolling a
distro patchset otherwise.
Generally I prefer to stay as close as possible to an upstream
release, to avoid our users seeking support upstream with our
downstream bugs.
A version 1.0.24.1 of plugins would be ideal. Is this in the cards please?

